1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
A 6-km wall you can walk in one full loop.
六公里城墙，能走一整圈

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,600
72 watchtowers, 6 gates, still standing.
72座敌楼，6座城门

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,900
Built around 1370 — and barely changed since.
建于1370，明代原貌

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,200
Inside: a whole Ming-Qing county town, alive.
城里，是活着的明清县城

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,500
On one street sat China's first bank.
一条街上，中国第一家银行

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,800
Rishengchang, 1823 — the first draft bank.
日升昌·1823·第一票号

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,100
It once moved nearly half of China's silver.
曾汇通天下，半国白银

8
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,400
UNESCO listed the whole city in 1997.
1997年，整座城列入世遗

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,900
★ Expert Tip: walk the wall at dawn, before the tour buses.
内行提示：清晨登城，避开旅游团

10
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:23,500
Pingyao or Xi'an — which walled city wins?
平遥还是西安，你站哪座城墙？
